  "answer_text": "IPS allowlist rules match differently from firewall rules: all matching IPS allowlist rules are applied to the traffic, and each matching rule can generate an event; this is different from an ordered firewall rulebase, where only the first matching rule is applied. To create an IPS allowlist rule directly from a block event, use Event Discovery to locate the IPS signature that blocked traffic, then click the signature ID in the event to open a window to configure a new IPS allowlist rule, which is added to Security > IPS. ",
